; Hand-written, and that is the point: this file is the thing Unreal could not give us. A scene as
; readable text that an agent can write, diff and review.
;
; A stub. Ground, sky and a light so `make godot-run` opens something rather than erroring. The
; stack itself is generated from data/levels/*.json, same as before — see rule 3, no hand-placed
; level geometry.

